{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lO0cDfVrCUUR99KX3Y1GLw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:15.387692+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lO0cDfVrCUUR99KX3Y1GLw","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/sia5TdXfTytL6JD9Q6KOficVyNN0zWFILhjTgIia4UVOsFP9I97ofMZNWyVVtlGTNE058yARpXPicHh4Aic40Nussbg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>为促进全国各高校优秀大学生互动与交流，近距离了解安徽医科大学第二临床医学院（第二附属医院）的优势学科、导师团队、科研平台、人才培养和就业前景等，我院将举办2026年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动。现面向全国高校招收营员，欢迎有意报考我院的优秀学子踊跃报名参加本次活动。</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/F0EDib1icpDmcIbPY72I9kX7yQen9Zww3iaoVFNribDZqtftBiaoTx4VV62wvY50icJ1gtQmTib9YVjtDo76swocIEfnG9S3NkGFsQEV0Vm69oQxKg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/F0EDib1icpDmd0QDWUxbEcCr17yHqVic4DYsju90iaJyZf7QeC7EcPVbEDdWN0PrBWosEoIvQ7QAx3GiaLxuIEbWyMFlW5WoA27kx9CLYlQRzsia8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/F0EDib1icpDmceyD0ghG1OQp2s7G1YdSWsuYXeqlJrYRZgicjuHmK9ibZegicPyudEmsQuNRKQeyK5jibJVrK9NIw90Ka1kf5rBSjxfVX3UJzQOO4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>单位简介</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/F0EDib1icpDmfLuQHrLHdjmAmibOHqIQN6O0p0CXwibE5c9yjZtfNRiaYEdurjibIx6LRk7gzaO0sImnNLKxtMnLRAC6uibbxNQJZ1VMG3pjUwzZhE/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>安徽医科大学第二附属医院是一所集医疗、教学、科研、预防、保健、康复等多功能于一体的三级甲等现代化综合性医院。</span></span></strong><span><span>医院于2008年开诊，2013年率先在安徽省按照原卫生部部颁标准通过国家三级医院等级评审。2017年初，医院以高分通过JCI国际认证（Joint Commission International, 医疗机构评审联合委员会国际部），成为安徽省首家获得JCI认证、全国第十家以学术型医学中心医院通过JCI评审的大型公立医院。医院现拥有4个国家临床重点专科建设项目（呼吸与危重症医学科、血液内科、眼科、重症医学科），14个省临床重点专科，省级临床研究中心1个,教育厅重点实验室1个；2023年获国家自然基金立项33项，位列全国医院前五十强。2024年，首次获得国自然联合基金重点支持项目立项资助3项；2025年获国家自然基金立项41项，再创新高。省科技进步奖5项，其中一等奖2项；省级教学成果特等奖1项，二等奖1项；12个学科位居中国医院科技量值（STEM）全国百强，6个学科入选五年总科技量值全国百强；罕见病、神经内科、麻醉学、肾脏内科及运动医学入选中国医院及专科声誉排行榜（复旦版）榜单，其中罕见病位列全国13名，神经内科、麻醉科均位列安徽第三名。在国家卫生健康委公布的2023年度全国三级公立医院绩效监测（国考）中位列全国67名，连续四年稳居A+等级。</span></span></p><p><span><span>医院目前开放床位2950张，现有职工3298人，其中高级职称657人，博士412人，在站博士后64人，教授/副教授179人，博士生导师93人次，硕士生导师506人次。国务院特殊津贴5人、省政府特殊津贴6人、国家卫生健康突出贡献中青年专家2人，国家卫生计生突贡中青年专家1人、省学术技术带头人及后备人选20人、江淮名医14人、省杰青3人、优青5人、省特支4人、皖江学者特聘教授1人、青年皖江学者2人、省卫生系统青年领军人才9人。在院学生（本科生、研究生、国培生、实习生）5000余人。2026年全院招收硕士研究生340人，博士研究生31人。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>医院始终秉持立德树人初心，以培育卓越医学人才为根本使命。</span></span></strong><span><span>建院以来，持续为健康中国事业输送大批高素质临床骨干，毕业生临床技能扎实、科研思维活跃、发展潜力深厚。未来，医院将锚定内涵式高质量发展，深化教育教学改革，强化创新驱动，着力建设特色鲜明的高水平临床医学人才培养高地，为广大学子铺就成长通途、搭建逐梦舞台。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/F0EDib1icpDmdKYraWJfB5vzBJNfoRZdkkVsoTk7rujCAPQMQLgGricsTAdBwyonRazoYTia8x4cBuicNWqhYicCX2rvVMvb675WRPJibOqVUkMQDo/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>2026年7月9日-7月15日</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>计划营员人数</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/F0EDib1icpDmcLnfDwf5qrWuuDTLEYiaCwriadib3UR7Ezqm8jDO9FG1FQmImVsByZianqGwhsnKE3udsN6YOdLn0HSq2ib3B0WvLg4IpbJO8mhVls/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>计划招收营员人数：50名</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>夏令营活动安排</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/F0EDib1icpDmcJ5JwEdnF0yrCUPGJ9PjhcWuH0oia4H6kHZAZ662fKo5ia3hZWwsWIv5MK9BzFZH9GdbpqYhk02Fcnslr31pyUjXZIulKNYDRia8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>本次活动预计在7月下旬举行，活动形式以线下的方式进行。具体安排以实际通知为准。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/F0EDib1icpDmdtK1XugbYAyK09eyj5vqZW35oBETcjavYuQ2anje4OFeiae9eyeaW1paGOGChYibGPrz4ypQIvWJBzgcjW4EibAgibae2zXvZLtag/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.拥护中国共产党领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></p><p><span>2.全日制2027届本科毕业生，且有意向报考我院硕士研究生的同学；</span></p><p><span>3.学习成绩优异，满足下列条件之一：（1）五年制或四年制医学专业学习成绩排名在同专业年级排名前30%；（2）安徽医科大学临床医学5+3专业学习成绩排名应在同专业年级前50%。</span></p><p><span>4.具有浓厚科研兴趣，有较强的研究能力；</span></p><p><span>5.英语水平满足下列条件之一：CET-6≥425分，CET-4≥480分，雅思IELTS考试≥5.5分，托福TOEFL网考≥90分。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/F0EDib1icpDmdgBM8HCZdJbSHuhLsVFQ8565su5lanctibxsPo5bXTkcYupYsicJsJ81ibeM4rPibPgtCEEecTLABtXzKVyBP0G6vOpwpianQMgvs0/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.报名材料清单：</span></span></p><p><span>①申请表（附件1）</span></p><p><span>②本科历年成绩单（加盖教务处公章）；</span></p><p><span>③英语水平的证明材料：全国大学生英语四级、六级考试成绩单或相关证书；</span></p><p><span>④其他相关能力的证明材料（如发表论文、专利、各类获奖证书等）；</span></p><p><span>⑤本人有效期内的身份证和学生证。</span></p><p><span>⑥汇总表（附件2）</span></p><p><span>2.提交方式与时间：</span></p><p><span>7月15日前将上述报名材料①-⑤按顺序扫描合并成一个PDF文件、与汇总表分别上传至下方链接，逾期不予受理。</span></p><p><span>报名材料审核通过后将以短信形式通知加入夏令营QQ群。未在规定时间内进群视为自动放弃，未入选者不再另行通知。</span></p><p><span>材料上传链接如下：</span></p><p><span>报名材料：https://yunbiz.wps.cn/c/collect/cmD1Wkvoejj；</span></p><p><span>汇总表：https://yunbiz.wps.cn/c/collect/cHRVTNOFnf7。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>学生食宿及资助安排</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/F0EDib1icpDmeDXUX3hzFXNEibag6MHSxlu3dhUbxYTxMeoScicodXO7eha2M4hshVg2kyCFuFCldfMYvbxdJtia3EQTmklwNdSZ1qoPX2ENDnVM/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>活动期间为营员提供一次工作餐（午餐）、合肥市外的营员住宿由医院统一安排，交通费自理。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/F0EDib1icpDmeOibZO9gxPOtbOXwl2qEpYGmh7bjB5slGXaARIvXbWkuSywEzXX5icyWEt8BFK9elfVMVEMV27iaEBGS7okLhtEYicI3cR14aZVsA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.本次夏令营活动不收取任何费用，第二临床医学院（第二附属医院）不承担参加者活动期间所产生的任何法律和经济责任；</span></span></p><p><span>2.营员报到时需携带身份证、学生证。在营期间，营员必须遵守医院的相关规定；任何弄虚作假、违反学术道德行为一经发现，将取消其一切录取资格； </span></p><p><span>3.医院官方网址：https://www.ay2fy.com/。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/F0EDib1icpDmdKmp4USSlD2ia9WDx9NrHFZwh0qY9jsTpSu5aoW5gfQHxQLic8QfUhS6QHv5rSTlQaTXtMSfxONL662U4Uss2eIkVicuPf8HAzjA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>联系人：余老师、王老师</span></span></p><p><span>联系电话：0551-63869360、0551-65997420</span></p><p><span>地址：安徽省合肥市经开区创业园路安徽医科大学南校区综合楼4楼教学管理部</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/F0EDib1icpDmfLia3GDEIsCrBGL964RYNNOic9ibXWekIibGA69iapM9qq3MdxmADZvQX55Qp2xp5Rfl3ib0br154ibhWCsRkNnh09IzvSDMI3uoWicrw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>热忱欢迎全国各高校2027届本科毕业生参加安徽医科大学第二临床医学院（第二附属医院）优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动！</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lO0cDfVrCUUR99KX3Y1GLw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1申请表.doc</a></span></span></p><p><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lO0cDfVrCUUR99KX3Y1GLw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2报名汇总表.xls</a></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/F0EDib1icpDmfVZ8VVwhjSg7BHUjNFHddr8ticnlenByRKCibamDseFlIyDq9Impa2YrmVCzlSM1P837DRjjp4QibpHNTF2kxYf32E1B4AVWUWiak/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/F0EDib1icpDmdX1AuFXBoibs8pGpkXic922LLNhgfkicpA236ibgx78RJdicUDbWgmJjRm8K8YIbibSKTS9SAhPxJKpAaJibLl8XJO1iaX05UC0ZlnNT4/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><strong><span>END</span></strong></section></section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/F0EDib1icpDmfVS28f3jBDGmUJSBkDuDdftenIDvA2icxOoice0qpKmhfllNJzPYr86vykz2wKlmSU70mC1qvWD1DC315Z6UGCi